1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,090
LEONARD:
Oh, great.

2
00:00:02,923 --> 00:00:07,053
-Your mom is not coming, right?
-Not this time. I promise.

3
00:00:07,928 --> 00:00:10,388
(Raj:)Just to be clear,
roller-skating was my idea.

4
00:00:10,555 --> 00:00:12,765
I'm unhappy
that you turned it into a date...

5
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:16,183
(Raj:)...and I hope you both fall on your asses
and break your coccyxes.

6
00:00:18,605 --> 00:00:21,855
The plural of "coccyx" is "coccyges."

7
00:00:22,025 --> 00:00:24,615
(Raj:)Screw you.
Give me back my lima beans.

8
00:00:27,281 --> 00:00:29,821
(Bernadette:)Oh, my God.
Have you ever been so embarrassed?

9
00:00:29,992 --> 00:00:31,122
(Penny:)Not recently.

10
00:00:31,285 --> 00:00:35,205
(Bernadette:)I don't know which was lamer,
their roller skating or their disco dancing.

11
00:00:35,372 --> 00:00:39,502
(Penny:)For me, the worst part was when
people saw us leave with them.

12
00:00:40,419 --> 00:00:44,339
(Leonard:)You had some nice moves out there,
Howard.

13
00:00:44,506 --> 00:00:47,716
(Howard:)-Thanks. You too.
-You noticed all the people looking at us?

14
00:00:48,885 --> 00:00:52,305
(Howard:)Not really. I was in my boogie zone.

15
00:00:53,557 --> 00:00:57,347
-And when Howard tried to do the splits?
-Shh.

16
00:00:57,519 --> 00:00:58,939
Sorry, I'm moving slow.

17
00:00:59,104 --> 00:01:02,104
(Leonard:)-I think I bruised my coccyx.
-Aw, poor baby.

